      "description": "Department: UMPI Human Resources Category: Information Technology [Sa1] JobSchedule: Full time PrimaryLocation: Presque Isle, ME, United States University of Maine System is seeking a Director of Campus Technology that will be located at the University of Maine at Presque Isle. All applications must be submitted only through the University of Maine System (UMS) job posting for Director of Campus Technology , where you will also find full position details. (Do not apply directly to the University of Maine at Presque Isle.) Link to posting: https://fa-ewca-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/3192 "
